    "audioStrategy": "Live synthesis only. One piano-like voice is generated in JavaScript from an additive partial bank with per-partial inharmonicity, per-partial decay, a deterministic hammer transient and a per-note release curve. The rendered samples are written into an AudioBuffer and played through Web Audio (source -> voice gain -> master gain -> destination). No recorded audio is loaded, bundled, fetched or streamed anywhere in this project.",
